#: ../../develop/porting.rst:4
msgid "Porting MicroPython"
msgstr "Prenošenje MicroPythona"

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:6
msgid ""
"The MicroPython project contains several ports to different microcontroller "
"families and architectures. The project repository has a `ports "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/tree/master/ports>`_ directory "
"containing a subdirectory for each supported port."
msgstr ""
"Projekt MicroPython sadrži nekoliko portova za različite obitelji "
"mikrokontrolera i arhitekture. Repozitorij projekta ima direktorij `ports "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/tree/master/ports>`_ koji sadrži"
" poddirektorij za svaki podržani port."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:10
msgid ""
"A port will typically contain definitions for multiple \"boards\", each of "
"which is a specific piece of hardware that that port can run on, e.g. a "
"development kit or device."
msgstr ""
"Port će tipično sadržavati definicije za više \"ploča\", od kojih je svaka "
"određeni komad sklopovlja na kojem taj port može raditi, npr. razvojni "
"komplet ili uređaj."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:13
msgid ""
"The `minimal port "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/tree/master/ports/minimal>`_ is "
"available as a simplified reference implementation of a MicroPython port.  "
"It can run on both the host system and an STM32F4xx MCU."
msgstr ""
"`Minimalni port "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/tree/master/ports/minimal>`_ "
"dostupan je kao pojednostavljena referentna implementacija MicroPython "
"porta. Može raditi i na host sustavu i na STM32F4xx MCU-u."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:17
msgid "In general, starting a port requires:"
msgstr "Općenito, pokretanje porta zahtijeva:"

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:19
msgid "Setting up the toolchain (configuring Makefiles, etc)."
msgstr "Postavljanje lanca alata (konfiguriranje Makefilea itd.)."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:20
msgid "Implementing boot configuration and CPU initialization."
msgstr "Implementaciju konfiguracije pokretanja i inicijalizacije CPU-a."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:21
msgid ""
"Initialising basic drivers required for development and debugging (e.g. "
"GPIO, UART)."
msgstr ""
"Inicijalizaciju osnovnih upravljačkih programa potrebnih za razvoj i "
"otklanjanje pogrešaka (npr. GPIO, UART)."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:22
msgid "Performing the board-specific configurations."
msgstr "Izvođenje konfiguracija specifičnih za ploču."

#: ../../develop/porting.rst:23
msgid "Implementing the port-specific modules."
msgstr "Implementaciju modula specifičnih za port."

